@startuml AD-3
!include _style.iuml
title AD-3 (System level) — Charge Point loses connection during a session, then reconcile\nTrigger: Charge Point's connection is lost while a session is active · Use cases: UC-INT-03, UC-OPS-03, UC-OPS-05, UC-CHG-04

|«person»\nDriver|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
|«external system»\nCharge Point|
|«person»\nOperator|
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
start
:Detect lost connection and\nshow Charge Point offline;
fork
  |«external system»\nCharge Point|
  :Keep charging and store\nmeter data locally;
fork again
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  :Tell Driver live data\nis delayed;
  |«person»\nDriver|
  :See "Charge Point offline,\ndata delayed" notice;
end fork
|«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
if ( ) then ([BR-P47: still offline after\n120 s grace period])
  :Mark session orphaned (shown on\nthe operator console) and void\nreservations (no fee);
  note right
    Operator alert: the Offline alert
    after 900 s (BR-P50, AD-7)
  end note
  :ChargingSession\n&#91;orphaned&#93;]
  :Reservation\n&#91;voided&#93;]
else ([reconnected within\n120 s grace period])
endif
if ( ) then ([Charge Point reconnects])
  |«external system»\nCharge Point|
  :Reconnect and send\nqueued meter data>
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
  :Discard duplicates and\nrebuild session timeline;
  if ( ) then ([session still running])
    :ChargingSession\n&#91;active&#93;]
    :Continue charging ⋔ (AD-1);
    stop
  else ([session stopped\nwhile offline])
    :Cross-check energy: start and\nstop totals against readings;
  endif
else ([no reconnection within\n24 h of being orphaned])
endif
if ( ) then ([BR-P48: energy conflict over tolerance\nor no reconnection])
  :Hold billing and flag\nsession for review;
  :ChargingSession\n&#91;review&#93;]
  |«person»\nOperator|
  :Resolve: accept Charge Point\ntotal, accept readings or void;
  |«software system»\nPowerMe Platform|
else ([consistent, or gap only\n(no energy conflict)])
endif
:Record reconciliation result\n(gap or conflict only);
:ReconciliationRecord]
:ChargingSession\n&#91;reconciled&#93;]
:Price per tariff period and\ndebit cost (void = no charge);
:CreditTransaction\n&#91;session_debit&#93;]
if ( ) then ([BR-P20: cost > credit balance:\nnew starts blocked\nuntil top-up])
  :CreditAccount\n&#91;in_shortfall&#93;]
else ([else])
endif
:Send charging statement;
|«person»\nDriver|
:View charging statement;
stop
@enduml
